WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.210
What is the slope of the curve x squared, right at x equals 3?

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:10.880
From 3 to 4, the line rises 7 over 1. Slope 7.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.540
From 3 to 3.1, slope 6.1.

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:19.100
From 3 to 3.01, slope 6.01.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.170
Each gap is smaller, and the answer creeps closer to 6.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:28.010
They are all heading for one number. The slope at 3 is 6.
